00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:13.540
The narrow, web-like streets stretching in all directions are packed with small buildings.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:19.450
The district has more than 30,000 apparel-related factories.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:24.410
The entire production process, from printing designs on fabric to sharing and sewing, can

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:28.050
