00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:12.230
In January 2020, Wuhan was locked down due to the spread of the coronavirus.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:20.230
The infection quickly spread in Guangzhou, and Hubei Village, known for its close ties to Wuhan, was soon restricted.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:30.430
